MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Buc_m01_001: In my experience, when your enemy appears not to\nbe making a move, they're likely inquiring after you.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Buc_m01_002: Which is why quiet times like these make me feel\nmost uneasy.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Buc_m01_003: You mustn't let your guard down, milady—not that I\nhave to remind you.
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Buc_m01: <BLN>Be on guard.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m01_001: Now that my lady assents to your planned revenge,\nI will do likewise.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m01_002: You shall continue to have my support, Miss Leda.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m01_003: I will see this through with you—and help release\nyou from this unmet desire.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m01_004: For that is what my loyalty to my lady requires.
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Sci_m01: <BLN>I've made up my mind.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m01_001: Adults really love ghosh, huh? I just don't get what\nthe fuss is about.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m01_002: You give me some freshly squeezed ginji juice with\na drizzle of honey, and then we're talking!
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m01_003: It's the best, especially after it's chilled awhile.\nWait—hmmm.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m01_004: I wonder what ghosh would taste like if you mixed in\na dash of glirmosa juice.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m01_005: This has got me thinking. I've gotta try that!
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Moo_m01: <BLN>How would that taste?
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Oly_m01_001: I suspect you'd have luck finding young ghosh if\nyou went to the tavern.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Oly_m01_002: The taverns in Dagsion begin stocking it quite early.
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Oly_m01: <BLN>The tavern, perhaps.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m01_001: When I awarded you the title "Rose of Caelus,"\nmaking you the youngest person to receive the title...
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m01_002: I hope you know it was not because you are\ndescended from Cohen.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m01_003: It was because of the raw strength I could hear when\nyou played the vihuela.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m01_004: My son Cohen was not able to reach such mastery\nwithout losing his life.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m01_005: If he could, he'd have performed as you did.\nThat is how I felt.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m01_006: The passion of your playing—the ferocity of it—\npierced the hearts of all who listened.
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Car_m01: <BLN>I hope you understand.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Buc_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Buc_m02_001: The last time I saw Anna was the day I left the\nimperial capital.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Buc_m02_002: Back in 1425, if memory serves...which means it's\nalready been 24 years.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Buc_m02_003: And yet, much to my surprise, it seems she hasn't\naged a day.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Buc_m02_004: One would expect even a demigod to come across\ndifferently after all that time...right?
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Buc_m02: <BLN>If memory serves...
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m02_001: Miss Leda, in the course of my life, I've become\nfamiliar with a wide variety of people.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m02_002: I believe the one we're looking for is not someone\nwho appears outwardly good or bad...
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m02_003: but someone who's skilled at staying hidden and\nguiding events toward their own desired outcome.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m02_004: I sense the shadow of such an entity behind these\nrecent events.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m02_005: Who knows? They may even be influencing your\nown actions.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Sci_m02_006: Tread carefully, Miss Leda. And do not let yourself\nbe taken in by appearances.
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Sci_m02: <BLN>It's beneath the surface.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m02_001: My mom said that I needed to know about magic to\nwork at Smyrnos's temple.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m02_002: So, she left home to make money for me to\napprentice under a big-shot mage.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m02_003: I should probably tell her sooner rather than later\nthat I'm at Kalla's temple...
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m02_004: But I'm not sure how to bring it up after all this time.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m02_005: I mean, Mom keeps making decisions for me without\nstopping once to think about how I feel!
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Moo_m02_006: Ugh, it's so frustrating. Yeah, no, I'm not telling her\na thing.
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Moo_m02: <BLN>How do I tell her?
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Oly_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Oly_m02_001: Ohhh... I can't think of a melody, and the deadline is\nfast approaching.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Oly_m02_002: Perhaps the pressure I'm feeling is impeding my\ncreative abilities.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Oly_m02_003: But if I don't succeed, it won't just be my own\nreputation I hurt. I'll damage the temple's as well!
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Oly_m02_004: Leilidahna...you know I'm loathe to ask for your\nassistance with such a task.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Oly_m02_005: But please, just this once, would you help me\ncompose a song?!
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Oly_m02: <BLN>I fear I'm in trouble...
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Nat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Nat_m01_001: *gasp* You— You're the girl!
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Nat_m01_002: None of us wants to cause a scene.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Nat_m01_003: I'll just close my eyes, and you'll run off and\ndisappear. Alright?
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Nat_m01: <BLN>Impossible!
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Hri_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Hri_m01_001: Rather bold, strolling around the city without a care.\nAfter the stunt you pulled!
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Hri_m01_002: Take that as a compliment if you like.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Hri_m01_003: Under different circumstances, we might not have\nbeen on opposing sides.
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Hri_m01: <BLN>Gods.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m02_001: Anna has served at the Divine Sovereign's side as a\npriest for quite some time now.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m02_002: Though...I realize that may have been hidden\nfrom the public.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m02_003: I wonder, when was it I first laid eyes on Anna?
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m02_004: Hmm, I can't recall, but I know it was long ago.
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_Car_m02_005: I'm sure she has her reasons for behaving the way\nshe does.
MID_LGA_1LED_c08_Car_m02: <BLN>When was it?